er role in the AI infrastructure. According to the company, it has teamed up with leading researchers worldwide to lay out a roadmap for co-packaged optics (CPO) in the journal Nature Electronics. Notably, beyond its HBM leadership, SK hynix’s paper tackles data bottlenecks at the rack and pod levels, outlining an optics-centric architecture that links memory and processors through optical interconnects. As hyperscale AI clusters scale to thousa</description><guid isPermaLink="false">7eb23e4e3e04</guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T05:22:37.379287+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 英文</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>国际海缆韧性咨询机构召开全体会议</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/550/a1313802.html</link><description>2026年7月10日，国际电信联盟国际海缆韧性咨询机构首届任期收官会议在瑞士日内瓦召开。该机构是国际电信联盟推动全球海缆治理体系建设的重要机制，下设海缆快速部署与维修风险监测与缓解地理路由多样性三个工作组，旨在凝聚各界力量，研究海缆建设与保护中的重大问题，推动形成国际共识和政策建议。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">4005ae721c7e</guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T05:22:37.379287+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_监管</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>晶湛半导体MicroLED光通信技术取得新突破</title><link>https://www.ledinside.cn/knowledge/20260617-61902.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">4f714797a13e</guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T05:22:37.379287+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 中文</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>联发科联合微软研究院等研发主动式MicroLED光缆</title><link>https://www.ledinside.cn/knowledge/20260318-61283.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">2e37d127b1c1</guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T05:22:37.379287+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 中文</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>应用案例 | 800G光模块订单激增，硅光芯片/FA耦合如何实现纳米级品质管控</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2813_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">0017e7f08fbd</guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T05:22:37.379287+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>前沿 | 利用AI打通超构表面全研发链路，纳境科技推出MetaODA超构表面AI一体化智算平台</title><link>https: